        "# Class variable\n",
        "\n",
        "A class variable is defined on a class and shared through attribute lookup by its instances, unless an instance shadows it with its own attribute.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-class-variable)"
      ]
